    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>🎶 OSSFEST 2026 – NORTH STAGE 🎶</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Saturday, July 25, The North Stage stitched By Sam &amp; The Painted Lady Posse with Love, comes alive with a full day of incredible live music as OSSFEST returns to celebrate Toronto's independent music community.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">From emerging <strong>local favourites</strong> to legendary <strong>Canadian icons,</strong> this year's lineup delivers a full spectrum of sounds across ten straight hours of live performances. Settle in for an afternoon and evening packed with rock, indie, folk, alternative, and everything in between.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Line up</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">2PM • Emma Campbell<br>3PM • Reposadists<br>4PM • Kunle<br>5PM • The Violet Archers<br>6PM • David B. Archibald<br>7PM • Brainfudge<br>8PM • Carole Pope<br>9PM • Blame Betty<br>10PM • Active Mirror</p>",
